# SuperD migrated from superd.anknovate.com to superdeliverygh.com -
# this sends every path on the old domain to the same path on the new
# one (not just the homepage), permanently. Must come before the SPA
# fallback rule below: Netlify _redirects matches top-to-bottom and
# stops at the first hit, and that rule below has no host qualifier so
# it'd otherwise swallow every request, including these, before this
# one ever got a chance to run.
https://superd.anknovate.com/*  https://superdeliverygh.com/:splat  301!

/*    /index.html   200
